  <!-- Page Header -->
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Mentorship</h1>
      <p class="page-header-subtitle">Find one. Be one. Both, maybe.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Overview -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Launching now</span>
      <h2>Good mentors change careers</h2>
      <p>We're starting a mentorship program for chapter members. Students, career changers, mid-career folks, senior people. Any pairing that makes sense.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who it's for -->
  <section class="content-section" style="background: var(--light-gray);">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Who it's for</span>
      <h2>Everyone, honestly</h2>
      <p>If you're getting into security or changing careers into it, find a mentor. If you're a few years in and want perspective from someone more senior, find a mentor. If you're senior and want to give back, or just want practice coaching, be one.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How pairing works -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">How it works</span>
      <h2>How pairing works</h2>
      <p>Sign up with a short note about yourself and whether you want to mentor, be mentored, or both. A chapter officer matches you with someone. The two of you figure out how often to meet, virtual or in person.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What we ask -->
  <section class="content-section" style="background: var(--light-gray);">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">What we ask</span>
      <h2>A few ground rules</h2>
      <p>Don't ghost each other. Follow the <a href="https://www.isc2.org/ethics">ISC2 Code of Ethics</a>. Actually show up. Even thirty minutes a month makes a difference.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to sign up?</h2>
      <p class="cta-subtitle">Let us know whether you'd like to mentor, be mentored, or both.</p>
      <div class="cta-banner-actions">
        <a href="mailto:membership@isc2chapter-tampabay.org?subject=Mentorship%20-%20Mentor" class="btn">Mentor Someone</a>
        <a href="mailto:membership@isc2chapter-tampabay.org?subject=Mentorship%20-%20Mentee" class="btn-outline btn-outline--light">Find a Mentor</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>